    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrPmbvGGnvOpplRBAeCDCEJZsgSM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.04 养猫香不香？养过就知道！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657c3f0ecab6086ec1e5c252</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657c3f0ecab6086ec1e5c252</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Dec 2023 11:57:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️主播 | 柠檬</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️嘉宾 | 湛湛</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的大学同学湛湛今年养了两只漂亮的小猫咪，一只叫王加耳，一只叫王加胃。做为一个八年的老铲屎官，我和新手铲屎官湛湛聊了聊各自养猫的故事。世界破破烂烂，小猫缝缝补补，希望全天下的小猫咪都能够健康长寿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏷️本期内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 哪个正经人给猫起名叫王加耳和王加胃啊 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 帮同事养完猫之后，决定要有自己的小猫咪 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 不是不想用领养代替购买，而是领养真的很难 &nbsp;</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 养狗VS养猫，我可能暂时只配养猫 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a> 多猫家庭真的会更省心吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 为什么流浪猫要剪耳？关于猫咪之前不知道的事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> 养猫崩溃瞬间回顾</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2944">49:04</a> 养猫真是太好了！关于小猫咪的治愈瞬间</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3266">54:26</a> 小猫咪绝对是养老利器！看完我爸妈养猫我酸了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3923">01:05:23</a> 温柔的小猫咪真的是要靠用心养的</span></p><span></span><p><span>📷图片补充</span></p><span></span><p><span>加耳和加胃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq_hPdKJH4im_N5LUkIA3uQtJ62j.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>火锅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh8dVoQySlG5NnLZxyOmrlUj7Uhp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📢收听方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以在小宇宙APP、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐找到我，搜索“客厅时间”收听并评论，参与互动。</span></p>]]></description>
